p97 : “Shaper’s Delight” will yield an excellently proportioned 10’6”. When finished, it will easily float persons up to 250 lbs. An excellent rental board. Nose rocker can be adjusted up to 6 1 / “ or lowered to 4 1 / “. Tail rocker can 2 2 be adjusted up to 1” or down 1 / “. Excellent fam2 ily board. Perfect San Onofre board or for those crowded days at your favorite point break. Great for giving lessons. Perfect for noseriding. May be used for guns with rocker adjustment and width removed from center prior to gluing. Suggested minimum stringer thickness: 3 / “. 16 Special note: All rockers for this blank will not fit on redwood or cedar.
